# 🚀 AI-Powered Customer Churn & Revenue Intelligence Platform

An end-to-end data analytics and machine learning project that predicts customer churn, identifies at-risk customers, estimates potential revenue exposure, and supports data-driven customer retention strategies using Python, machine learning, and Power BI.

## 📌 Project Overview

Customer churn is a major challenge for subscription-based businesses. Retaining existing customers requires businesses to understand customer behavior, identify potential churn risks, and develop effective retention strategies.

This project combines data engineering, exploratory data analysis (EDA), machine learning, explainable AI, revenue risk analysis, and business intelligence to turn customer data into actionable business insights.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Predict customers who are likely to churn.
- Identify factors associated with customer churn.
- Segment customers according to churn risk.
- Estimate monthly and annual revenue exposure.
- Recommend targeted customer retention actions.
- Visualize customer churn and revenue risk through an interactive Power BI dashboard.

## ⭐ Key Results

| Key Indicator | Result |
|---|---:|
| Customers Analyzed | 7,043 |
| Overall Churn Rate | 26.54% |
| Model ROC-AUC | 83.66% |
| High-Risk Customers | 730 |
| Medium-Risk Customers | 1,292 |
| Low-Risk Customers | 5,021 |
| Estimated Monthly Revenue Exposure | $139,030.10 |
| Estimated Annual Revenue Exposure | $1,668,361.17 |

**Note:** Revenue exposure represents an estimate based on the project's methodology. It is not confirmed revenue loss or guaranteed savings.

